msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「Well, if it isn't Takasu-kun!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya, pero si es Takasu-kun!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're...... Kushieda...... right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú eres...... Kushieda...... ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Minori「Verily! I am the humble Kushieda＿Minori.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡En efecto! Soy la humilde＿Kushieda Minori.」"

msgid "Minori「Your memories have yet to return, I＿take it?」"
msgstr "Minori「Supongo que tus recuerdos aún＿no han regresado, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not yet, no.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Todavía no.」"

msgid "Minori「I see, I see. Well, no need to rush...... OR＿IS THERE? HMM? Which is it?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo, ya veo. No hay prisa......＿¿O SÍ? ¿HMM? ¿En qué quedamos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Haha, you're so weird...... Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Jaja, eres tan rara...... ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the? This feeling deep in my＿chest...... Pain?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué pasa? Esta sensación en el fondo＿de mi pecho...... ¿Dolor?）」"

msgid "Minori「Hm? What's eatin' ya?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Hm? ¿Qué te pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing...... That's a lot of luggage. Are＿you going on a trip or something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada...... Llevas mucho equipaje.＿¿Te vas de viaje o algo así?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're going by yourself?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Vas tú sola?」"

msgid "Minori「Well you see, I was supposed to leave＿yesterday with my family, but my boss＿BEGGED me to come in to work, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, verás, se suponía que saldría＿ayer con mi familia, pero mi jefe me＿ROGÓ que fuera a trabajar, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. Enjoy your vacation.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Disfruta tus vacaciones.」"

msgid "Minori「Now Kushieda Minori must go! Laters!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Kushieda Minori parte! ¡Nos vemos!」"

msgid "Call out to Minori"
msgstr "Llamar a Minori"

msgid "Let her go"
msgstr "Dejarla ir"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, is the train here already?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, ya llegó el tren?」"

msgid "Minori「No, I still have some time, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「No, aún tengo tiempo, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that case, I'd like to talk a little more.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces me gustaría hablar un poco más.」"

msgid "Minori「I see, I see. In that case, bring it ONNN!」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo, ya veo. ¡Pues dale con TODOOO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Take care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuídate.」"

msgid "Minori「Thanks for your concern! Laters!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Gracias por preocuparte! ¡Nos vemos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Oh, I should have asked her when＿she'll be back.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Ah, debí preguntarle＿cuándo volverá.）」"

msgid "Minori「Actually, I'm on my way to my＿grandma's place, bud. This is just＿spare clothes, you know, overnight」"
msgstr "Minori「En realidad, voy a casa＿de mi abuela, amigo.」"

msgid "Minori「stuff.」"
msgstr "Minori「Es ropa de cambio, ya sabes,＿cosas para pasar la noche.」"

msgid "Minori「A true Kushieda would do anything for＿someone in need! Except stripping,＿that is. So yeah, I stayed behind to」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Una verdadera Kushieda haría＿todo por quien lo necesite! Salvo＿desnudarse, claro.」"

msgid "Minori「work.」"
msgstr "Minori「Así que me quedé a trabajar.」"
